REM Hello World - Basic test payload
REM Opens Notepad and types a message
REM Use this to verify your ESP32-S3 ducky is working

DELAY 1000
GUI r
DELAY 500
STRING notepad
ENTER
DELAY 800
STRING ==============================
ENTER
STRING   Hello from ESP32-S3 Ducky!
ENTER
STRING   Your DIY Rubber Ducky works!
ENTER
STRING ==============================
ENTER
